They're near universally low-lives not connected to anyone of importance, suspected of drug abuse. under the influence of disciplines, drugs, low blood, blackmail, likely to mistrust police and media, and fearful of vampire reprisal, what do you think they are going to do? <br /> <br /> please, consider what the reality of the situation would be before you throw around statements of 'ignoring facts'.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-03T11:46:14-07:00","id":1400794,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1286419-the-masquerade-is-mechanicaly-unsustainable?p=1400788#post1400788\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">who da fuck takes a blood doll seriously? They're near universally low-lives not connected to anyone of importance, suspected of drug abuse. under the influence of disciplines, drugs, low blood, blackmail, likely to mistrust police and media, and fearful of vampire reprisal, what do you think they are going to do?<br /> <br /> please, consider what the reality of the situation would be before you throw around statements of 'ignoring facts'.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, which is why there's actually a robust middle ground.<br /> <br /> When a Prince is concerned about a vampire breaking the Masquerade, he's not afraid of the Second Inquisition being created [which is probably as bad as it could possibly get before full-on collapse] but more like the Frog Brothers.<br /> <br /> Most hunters will live tragically short lives but it doesn't take THAT much effort for them to get some gas cans and burn down a vampire's haven during the day.<br /> <br /> And that is obviously going to piss the local vampires off.<br /> <br /> I also wager that 99% of the people who DO find out vampires are real later rationalize it away or just try and live their lives WITHOUT becoming a dedicated warrior against evil.<br /> <br /> Example:<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:16px\"><i>&quot;I remember my sister being killed at a party by a guy who drank her blood. My psychologist explained this is a false memory created by her sudden and inexplicable death. I mean, the alternative is silly.&quot;</i></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 07-03-2020, 03:12 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-03T12:09:43-07:00","id":1400803,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1286419-the-masquerade-is-mechanicaly-unsustainable?p=1400794#post1400794\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yes, which is why there's actually a robust middle ground.<br /> <br /> When a Prince is concerned about a vampire breaking the Masquerade, he's not afraid of the Second Inquisition being created [which is probably as bad as it could possibly get before full-on collapse] but more like the Frog Brothers.<br /> <br /> Most hunters will live tragically short lives but it doesn't take THAT much effort for them to get some gas cans and burn down a vampire's haven during the day.<br /> <br /> And that is obviously going to piss the local vampires off.<br /> <br /> I also wager that 99% of the people who DO find out vampires are real later rationalize it away or just try and live their lives WITHOUT becoming a dedicated warrior against evil.<br /> <br /> Example:<br /> <br /> &quot;I remember my sister being killed at a party by a guy who drank her blood. My psychologist explained this is a false memory created by her sudden and inexplicable death. I mean, the alternative is silly.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Agree. This can be more or less seen in the TV Series Lucifer. There is it good shown on three characters finding out angels and demons are true, how their whole live is turned upside down and it shown there too, that you can say the truth about what you are and people will not believe it.<br /> Okay it is a series and is about heaven and hell but I think it can give you a good impresion about how people can deny it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>As I am from Austria I need to clarify two things.<br /> First my native language is german and so please point out if the english I write is broken so I can improve.<br /> Second I do not own VTMV beyond first three books nor any line after M20 Corebook because it is not out there and I wait for the translation.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26160-koronus","name":"Koronus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"366"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-03T13:21:54-07:00","id":1400818,"title":"","content":"<b>&quot;If you depend on the stupidity of your enemy to succed you have alredy failed&quot;</b> <div align=\"right\">As fuck ups by a growing and overpopulated group of monster who feed on blood the masquerade weakens until eventualy is not substainable</div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.deviantart.com/cicerondixit/gallery\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.deviantart.com/cicerondixit/gallery</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24037-leandro16","name":"Leandro16","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24037_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"552"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-03T14:00:21-07:00","id":1400821,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leandro16</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1286419-the-masquerade-is-mechanicaly-unsustainable?p=1400818#post1400818\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>&quot;If you depend on the stupidity of your enemy to succed you have alredy failed&quot;</b> <div align=\"right\">As fuck ups by a growing and overpopulated group of monster who feed on blood the masquerade weakens until eventualy is not substainable</div> </div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, which is why the Second Inquisition exists.<br /> <br /> Mind you, I did have a Priest of Caine PC say that he thinks the Masquerade is unbreakable.<br /> <br /> <i><b>&quot;One day, the Masquerade will be broken. It will be on all the networks, all the buzzfeeds, and everyone will believe. Then the next day, no on